{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/b2f22e17c20369b124fca82f78795fa4.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It is a dystopian world in which a fierce struggle is being waged to take control of the databases that have been monopolized by large corporations that have brought misery and discrimination to the people living in the lower districts.<br>These large corporations have been ruling all the districts with an iron fist and oppressing the lower classes by forcing them to survive on the scraps that these corporations discard.<br>A small group of rebels has broken through into de Neo World to rise against these big corporations at the rhythm of their music hoping to restore the balance of power between the districts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8840478387c0f1a7ad76d0dda29c419a.avif?t=1772727375\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Main mode of Neo Dance where you can experience all styles of gameplay, our original songs, chat with NPCs and explore the Neo Dance districts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/3d19b318fa093663fcfee3f66dbc79ab.avif?t=1772727375\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat enemies with the rhythm of the songs in the main game mode.<br></li><li>Combat will change from 2 point mode to 4 point mode which will increase the feeling of rhythm and difficulty of the game.<br></li><li>Face the leaders of each district under the command of \u201cNova Corp\u201d.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/a01b3a4ab786f01576c07159076c370a.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/a01b3a4ab786f01576c07159076c370a.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/a01b3a4ab786f01576c07159076c370a.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>bonus Mode to Access other Districts.<br></li><li>Different style of music and player's perspective.<br></li><li>It gives the feeling of programming a code to hack a system.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2559020?t=1772727375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772727375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/0808e30c739ccf43bd02ce076da9abb5cf8d97a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772727375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/0808e30c739ccf43bd02ce076da9abb5cf8d97a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772727375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below you will find a complete breakdown of all the updates planned for early access, including the systems and content that each one will incorporate:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/43df62e8f9540aacf312411d4bed71eb.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This roadmap is preliminary and may evolve during development. Feedback from the community will be key, and we may adjust the order of updates, add, remove, or modify elements throughout early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even so, its purpose is to offer a clear vision of the content that Neo Dance will include in its final version, as well as the milestones we will focus on during each stage of early access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/d0d5c78e80909250ad94eed178442d7c.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first version lays the foundation for the game's visual and musical identity. A song pack is coming to expand the initial repertoire, and the interface is getting a comprehensive graphical overhaul, making it cleaner, more immersive, and more functional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/b320029266c6542ffa6e1c929e190d87.avif?t=1772727375\" width=650 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are introducing the note tempo system. Gameplay becomes more technical and precise: now the notes dance to the actual beat of the music, improving synchronization and the rhythmic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/89a6e5bf08901e5eeec3ba8ef17f7631.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New bosses are coming to test your synchronization, accompanied by another song pack to keep the repertoire fresh and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e9c42eab9063aa36e290989a5101ac8e.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virus mode arrives. A new way to play that alters the rhythm and forces you to survive the chaos. Can you stay focused when everything around you is confusing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/26b22c827c4b26240a8a0296142096d7.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We incorporate suggestions and feedback from our players, along with new artistic content that enriches the visual identity of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/a86dda22e5ca6bb2f4c482b72cedc9a7.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We bring you an improved ranking system to measure your scores and compete, rotating songs that renew the experience from time to time, and, of course, another song pack to keep adding hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/67b31b12b9ce02124bef618dadae86da.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're taking the leap into collective creativity. We've added a song editor and the ability to include songs created by the community. The game is no longer just ours: it's yours too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/87d95f51ee3deea71da5a7ee643ff8ef.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another round of improvements based on your feedback. We've refined the overall experience, fixed friction points, and listened to your most requested features to pave the way for what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/fae4306d2ae3928ce8720480295b27df.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're launching Story Mode. Context, characters, and a narrative that gives meaning to each beat. You're no longer just playing: you're advancing, discovering, and connecting with the world we're building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/83532cbcd1586262d3bbc926199b6abe.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last stop before the big launch. A new wave of changes driven by your suggestions. The game is more balanced, polished, and closer to what we always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/53b9546aa32c9abee214626ca1a1a81c.avif?t=1772727375\" width=650 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official launch! We close this stage with a special song pack, the introduction of a new playable character, and the most solid and complete version to date. This is just the beginning.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/b2f22e17c20369b124fca82f78795fa4.avif?t=1772727375\" width=651 height=387 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/e5c2329643264cdb60bdb1b589f364df.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It is a dystopian world in which a fierce struggle is being waged to take control of the databases that have been monopolized by large corporations that have brought misery and discrimination to the people living in the lower districts.<br>These large corporations have been ruling all the districts with an iron fist and oppressing the lower classes by forcing them to survive on the scraps that these corporations discard.<br>A small group of rebels has broken through into de Neo World to rise against these big corporations at the rhythm of their music hoping to restore the balance of power between the districts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8840478387c0f1a7ad76d0dda29c419a.avif?t=1772727375\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Main mode of Neo Dance where you can experience all styles of gameplay, our original songs, chat with NPCs and explore the Neo Dance districts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/38043cf1ca461cf8b05a56c520f974c1.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/3d19b318fa093663fcfee3f66dbc79ab.avif?t=1772727375\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.poster.avif?t=1772727375\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.webm?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559020/extras/8aaff2a06a4024d60e174341938e17c3.mp4?t=1772727375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat enemies with the rhythm of the songs in the main game mode.<br></li><li>Combat will change from 2 point mode to 4 point mode which will increase the feeling of rhythm and difficulty of the game.<br></li><li>Face the leaders of each district under the command of \u201cNova Corp\u201d.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline pos